										<string name="Text">Edit &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(255,170,0)&quot;&gt;UNLIMITED&lt;/font&gt; outfits/accessories for &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(0,255,127)&quot;&gt;FREE&lt;/font&gt; &#226;&#128;&#148; no &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(0,255,127)&quot;&gt;Custom Tailor Tokens&lt;/font&gt; or &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(0,255,127)&quot;&gt;Peli&lt;/font&gt; needed while subscribed. Fully recolor any outfit or accessory, and rotate/move accessories. &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(255,0,0)&quot;&gt;DOES NOT APPLY TO FRUITS/WEAPONS&lt;/font&gt;</string>
